Type: Project
Package: SportsAnalyticsApp
Title: G League Shot Analytics Shiny App
Version: 0.2.0
Description: Shiny app for G League shooting by court zone: player profiles,
    comparisons, teams, leaders and player types, with sign-in and admin
    screens. Lists the packages for CI (r-lib/actions/setup-r-dependencies);
    the app version itself is APP_VERSION in global.R.
